        "section": "nanotechnology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Nanotechnology Applications: Nanocomposites, Coatings, Catalysis, Energy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "AEROSPACE QUALIFICATION:\n  FAA/EASA: extensive coupon + component + full-scale testing required\n  Certification timeline: 5-10 years for structural application\n  Data requirement: full material property characterization\n    including fatigue, impact, environmental (humidity, temperature cycling)\n```"
    },
